### Agentizr realtime capabilities (read-only)

@baseUrl = {{$dotenv AGENTIZR_BASE_URL}}
@token = {{$dotenv AGENTIZR_REALTIME_TOKEN}}
@agentName = {{$dotenv AGENTIZR_AGENT_NAME}}

### Inspect active definition policy - expected 200 JSON, 401/403 or 404
# @name getRealtimeCapabilities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agents/{{agentName}}/realtime/capabilities HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
